WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.567
What if your product is a whole website?

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:07.027
With Selling Sites, a subscription plan sells a website:

00:00:07.027 --> 00:00:11.771
the buyer names their new site and its administrator during checkout, pays, and

00:00:11.771 --> 00:00:15.175
gets a running site of their own a minute or two later.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:18.635
This video shows how to set up a plan that sells a site,

00:00:18.635 --> 00:00:23.100
what the buyer sees, and how to watch, and fix, the creation of the sites.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:33.050
Agencies, platforms and software services sell sites, not just products.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:39.200
A buyer wants a site of their own, with their own administrator, soon after paying.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:43.190
And a failed setup must never lose the sale.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:52.037
A site plan is an ordinary subscription plan with the Tenant Onboarding part,

00:00:52.037 --> 00:00:54.780
and the recipe the new site is set up from.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:02.440
At checkout, a Your new site step asks for the site's name, title, address and administrator.

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:08.542
After payment, the site is created in the background, and the buyer follows

00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:09.930
it on My Sites.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:15.613
Administrators see every job under Site provisioning, and can retry a site that

00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:17.180
could not be created.

00:01:21.366 --> 00:01:28.337
Open the plan's content type, under Content Definition, Content Types, and add the Tenant Onboarding part.

00:01:28.337 --> 00:01:30.266
Click Add Selected Parts.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:32.611
Open a plan of that type.

00:01:32.611 --> 00:01:37.193
Under Tenant Onboarding, pick the Recipe the new site is set up from:

00:01:37.193 --> 00:01:38.476
it is required.

00:01:38.476 --> 00:01:39.514
Here, Blog.

00:01:39.514 --> 00:01:43.607
Set the price and billing terms as for any plan, and publish.

00:01:45.198 --> 00:01:51.862
New sites are created on the database chosen on the Tenant Onboarding tab of Settings, Subscriptions.

00:01:51.862 --> 00:01:53.918
The buyer never chooses it.

00:01:53.918 --> 00:01:58.589
Sqlite, a file per site, is the default and needs no database server.

00:01:58.589 --> 00:02:04.568
Other providers need a connection string, which is stored encrypted and never shown again.

00:02:08.764 --> 00:02:11.604
On the Plans page, a buyer clicks Sign up.

00:02:11.604 --> 00:02:15.983
Checkout adds a Your new site step, before the payment step, for the

00:02:15.983 --> 00:02:18.704
details of the site the buyer is buying.

00:02:19.157 --> 00:02:23.324
Site name identifies the site and cannot be changed later.

00:02:23.324 --> 00:02:27.621
Site title is what visitors see, and can change at any time.

00:02:27.621 --> 00:02:31.657
URL prefix is the part of the address after your domain.

00:02:31.657 --> 00:02:33.871
Custom domains are optional.

00:02:33.871 --> 00:02:37.257
And Site template starts on the plan's recipe.

00:02:37.707 --> 00:02:43.073
Under Site administrator, the buyer enters the user name, email and password they

00:02:43.073 --> 00:02:45.663
will sign in to their new site with.

00:02:45.663 --> 00:02:49.487
Everything the buyer can fix is checked before they pay:

00:02:49.487 --> 00:02:55.037
a taken name, a prefix that belongs to another site, or passwords that do not match.

00:02:55.488 --> 00:02:57.156
Then the buyer pays.

00:02:57.156 --> 00:03:01.968
Here with Pay Later, as this demonstration site has no card provider.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:10.135
On My Sites, in the buyer's account, the site is listed with its

00:03:10.135 --> 00:03:12.344
Site name and when it was bought.

00:03:12.344 --> 00:03:16.252
While it is being created, a note says a new site usually takes

00:03:16.252 --> 00:03:20.500
a minute or two to appear, and the page refreshes when you reload it.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:29.872
Administrators see every sold site under Subscriptions, Site provisioning:

00:03:29.872 --> 00:03:35.120
the site name, its status, the owner, when it was bought, and the attempts.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:38.489
The site checks for waiting jobs every minute.

00:03:38.489 --> 00:03:42.116
Waiting means it is paid for and waiting its turn.

00:03:42.116 --> 00:03:46.198
Created means the site exists, and the buyer can sign in.

00:03:46.198 --> 00:03:50.150
To try a waiting job now, click Retry now, and confirm.

00:03:51.746 --> 00:03:54.281
Back on My Sites, the site is Ready.

00:03:54.281 --> 00:04:00.076
Open takes the buyer to it, to sign in with the administrator account entered at checkout.

00:04:04.276 --> 00:04:09.415
On My Sites, a buyer sees Being created, Retrying, Ready, or Needs help.

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:13.566
For a site that needs help, the page says it could not be

00:04:13.566 --> 00:04:16.136
finished, and to contact support.

00:04:16.886 --> 00:04:22.958
Under Site provisioning, a job is Waiting, Being created, Created, Retrying, with a

00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:27.871
longer wait after each failure, or Abandoned, after five failures.

00:04:27.871 --> 00:04:30.396
Retry now starts a fresh count.

00:04:31.146 --> 00:04:33.579
An abandoned job needs a person:

00:04:33.579 --> 00:04:39.533
the administrator password the buyer entered is discarded, so Retry now is not offered.

00:04:39.533 --> 00:04:44.911
Create the site by hand under Tenants, optionally type its address, click Mark

00:04:44.911 --> 00:04:47.536
as created, or refund the purchase.

00:04:48.286 --> 00:04:52.687
A sold site runs as long as the subscription is current, including the

00:04:52.687 --> 00:04:57.262
period paid after cancelling and the grace period after a failed payment.

00:04:57.262 --> 00:05:00.216
After that the site is disabled, not deleted.

00:05:04.416 --> 00:05:05.563
An agency:

00:05:05.563 --> 00:05:09.936
a starter site for every new client, on a monthly plan.

00:05:10.686 --> 00:05:12.302
A software service:

00:05:12.302 --> 00:05:15.146
a running tenant for every subscriber.

00:05:15.896 --> 00:05:17.345
A blogging platform:

00:05:17.345 --> 00:05:19.686
a blog of their own for each member.

00:05:21.686 --> 00:05:25.992
With Selling Sites, every subscription can come with a site of its own,

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:29.012
created for you, and fixable when it needs help.

00:05:29.012 --> 00:05:30.466
Thanks for watching.

